# Re-resolves the reference to the CORRECT instance based on its object path.
# ==========================================
# When references are not passed cleanly, Omnis creates a COPY of the instance in memory.
# You can spot this (use right mouse click) by an instance name starting with an underscore,
# e.g. ____42134_EntityCtr.

If pfRef.$objectpath.$cando ## accessor exists
	Calculate objectPath as pfRef.$objectpath()
Else If pfRef.iObjectpath.$cando ## otherwise via hard access
	Calculate objectPath as pfRef.iObjectpath
End If

If len(objectPath)
	Set reference pfRef to [objectPath].$ref
End If

Quit method